### expansion starting with a second brace
echo "${{config}"
>>> SC2296 1:9

### expansion starting with a dot
echo "${.config}"
>>> SC2296 1:9

### plain braced expansion is fine
release=1.2
echo "${release}"
>>> none

### special parameters and operators are fine
sleep 1 &
echo $# ${#} $! ${!} ${!#} ${#!}
>>> none
